the sufficiency of our existing cash, cash equivalents, and investments to fund our future operating expenses and capital expenditure requirements;

our estimates or expectations regarding future revenues from commercial operations or otherwise, expenses, potential for cashflow positive operations, anticipated capital requirements to fund our future operating expenses, and our need for additional financing;

